{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04486","headline":"秋日遇荆州府崔兵曹使宴 · 陈子昂","name":"秋日遇荆州府崔兵曹使宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"輶轩凤皇使，林薮鶡鸡冠。\n江湖一相许，云雾坐交欢。\n兴尽崔亭伯，言忘释道安。\n林光稍欲暮，岁物已将阑。\n古树苍烟断，虚亭白露寒。\n瑶琴山水曲，今日爲君弹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}